{"url": "https://fatbeam.com", "content": "# Build. Connect. Grow.\n\n## We provide fiber optic internet services to businesses, schools, hospitals and government entities in the Pacific Northwest.\n\n[Request A Quote](https://fatbeam.com/request-quote)\n\n## About Fatbeam\n\nFatbeam is a rapidly growing fiber internet provider in the Pacific Northwest. We own and operate a lit fiber network in the communities of Coeur d'Alene, Spokane, Tri-Cities, Yakima, Wenatchee, Lewiston-Clarkston, Marysville, Burlington and Olympia. Our network also extends to locations in Montana and Utah. We currently serve over 2,500 business customers, including hospitals, healthcare providers, schools, local governments, and businesses throughout the Pacific Northwest.\n\n## Services\n\n[Fiber Internet](https://fatbeam.com/fiber-internet)\n\nFatbeam offers symmetrical fiber internet speeds from 10 Mbps to 10 Gbps for businesses in the Pacific Northwest.\n\n[Dark Fiber](https://fatbeam.com/dark-fiber)\n\nFatbeam designs, builds, and maintains high-capacity dark fiber networks for organizations that need their own dedicated fiber infrastructure.\n

