{"url": "https://fatbeam.com/dark-fiber", "content": "# Dark Fiber\n\n## Fatbeam designs, builds, and maintains high-capacity dark fiber networks for organizations that need their own dedicated fiber infrastructure.\n\n[Request A Quote](https://fatbeam.com/request-quote)\n\n## Dark Fiber Networks\n\nFatbeam's dark fiber division builds custom fiber optic infrastructure for businesses, utilities, and governments that need maximum control over their network. We handle everything from design, permitting, and installation, to ongoing operations and maintenance.\n\n## What We Do\n\n- Design\n- Permitting\n- Splicing\n- Testing\n- Underground & Aerial Installation\n\n## Why Fatbeam Dark Fiber\n\n### Local Expertise\n\nFatbeam has decades of experience deploying fiber in the Pacific Northwest, navigating complex terrain, permitting environments, and regulatory requirements.\n\n"We provide local, on-the-ground expertise to ensure projects are completed efficiently and on time."\n\n### Partner with Fatbeam\n\nFatbeam provides turnkey fiber solutions from design through deployment. Whether you're building a new network from scratch or expanding existing infrastructure, Fatbeam can manage the entire project lifecycle.\n\n### Quality Construction\n\nAll Fatbeam builds are performed to BICSI and industry standards, ensuring long-term reliability.\n\n## Contact Fatbeam\n\n[Contact Us](https://fatbeam.com/contact)\n\n© 2024 Fatbeam LLC\n\n[Privacy Policy](https://fatbeam.com/privacy-policy)  [Terms of Service](https://fatbeam.com/terms-of-service)\n"}
