{"url": "https://fatbeam.com/network", "content": "# Our Network\n\n## Fatbeam owns and operates a fiber optic network across the Pacific Northwest.\n\n[Request A Quote](https://fatbeam.com/request-quote)\n\n## Network Footprint\n\nFatbeam's network spans multiple markets across Washington, Idaho, Montana and Utah. We operate lit fiber and dark fiber infrastructure across the region, with ongoing expansion into new markets.\n\n### Current Markets\n\n- Coeur d'Alene, ID\n- Spokane, WA\n- Tri-Cities, WA\n- Yakima, WA\n- Wenatchee, WA\n- Lewiston-Clarkston, ID/WA\n- Marysville, WA\n- Burlington, WA\n- Olympia, WA\n- Montana (select locations)\n- Utah (select locations)\n\n## Network Capabilities\n\nFatbeam operates both lit fiber (active wavelengths for business internet) and dark fiber (passive infrastructure leased to enterprise, government, and utility customers). Our network is built to carrier-grade standards.\n\n## Expansion\n\nFatbeam continues to expand its footprint. If you're interested in connectivity in a market we don't currently serve, contact us to discuss options.\n\n[Request A Quote](https://fatbeam.com/request-quote)\n\n© 2024 Fatbeam LLC\n\n[Privacy Policy](https://fatbeam.com/privacy-policy)  [Terms of Service](https://fatbeam.com/terms-of-service)\n"}
